        <paragraph>ⓐ $$r^{2} + 12r + 36 = 0$$ ⓑ $$8t^{2} - 11t + 5 = 0$$ ⓒ $$3v^{2} - 5v - 1 = 0$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>ⓐ $$11$$ ⓑ $$no real solutionsno real solutions$$ ⓒ $$22$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
